{"obsah":"<p>We have our first camp dedicated to women and girls who wanted to improve their technique and style on the bike behind us. Almost ideal sunny weather – meaning neither cold nor hot – underlined the relaxed atmosphere and gave everyone the energy to progress on the pump track, in the skills centre and on a ride in the surrounding forests. </p>\n\n<p>Katarína and Vlasta were available, as well as Mára and Lukáš. The latter dived into the action literally headfirst, and besides an exhibition after lunch he also demonstrated the master carpenter's mistake – a silly crash. He came away with a bruised finger.</p>\n\n<p>Lunch was also sorted successfully, and Mára's workshop took place in relaxed mode. All day everyone had the chance to compete for MALOJA jerseys donated by LEVELSPORTKONCEPT. The condition for winning wasn't to be the best but to make the biggest progress. In the end the instructors' vote produced two winners – congratulations.</p>\n\n<p>We look forward to the next camp for intermediate men on 23 May. We're also preparing a trail version for women and men.</p>\n\n<p>In the meantime Vlasta and club colleagues Petr Jeřicha and Martin Vavřinec popped over to Czech Television for the programme Náš venkov to present the Kolovraty – Mnichovice cycle path.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery columns-3 is-cropped\"><ul class=\"blocks-gallery-grid\"><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F05%2Fholky-ladi-bikeskills-no122.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2021%2F05%2Fholky-ladi-bikeskills-no122.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" data-id=\"191506\" data-link=\"https://bikeskills.cz/?attachment_id=191506\" class=\"wp-image-191506\"/></a></figure></li><li class=\"blocks-gallery-item\"><figure><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/